    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Manase kūbiza ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Manase walī na myak'ikūmi n'ībīlī aho alandya kūbiza ntemi, ūsuga alī mu Yelusalemu ikanza lya myaka makūmi atanò n'ītanò. Ū nina witanagwa ī lina lyakwe Hefuziba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akīīta yabūbi no ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, kūlwa kūlondeela nhūngwa ja mahanga ga banhū abo SEEBA walī wabapeeja gīkī babīngīle a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgazenga hangī a mapandī ga higūlya ayo ise Hezekia walī wagakenaagūla, ūzenga na ng'walīlo kūlwa ng'wa Balī, na ng'hīngī ya ng'wa Ashela ūbeeja, gīt'ūmo walī wītīla Ahabu ntemi wa Isilaeli; na a mabità ga sonda ja ng'wigūlū a gose waginamīlaga na kūgalamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na myalīlo ūzenga ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, īyo ū SEEBA walī wahaya, “Ī lina lyane nakūlītūūla mu Yelusalemu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gwalugwa ja ha hekalu būbīlī wajo ūzenga myalīlo kūlwa nguno ya mabità gose ga sonda ja ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'witūnja wakwe ūmpemba mu moto kūlwa kūmfunya shitambò; ūbiza munhū wa kūtūmamīla nguzu ja giiti, ī mihayo ya būchembelwa wa ngoko yūbiza yakwe, ūyūkooba na būgunanhwa kūfuma kū banhū ba masamvwa ga būlagūji, na myoyo misoso ya mbika jingī na jingī. Ūmpelanya no ū SEEBA nguno ya mihayo yamalofu ī yose īyo wīyītaga ū mu miso gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akasula shiikolile sha lī Ashela hūna ūshisola ūshitūūla mu hekalu, īyo ū SEEBA walī wang'wīla ū Daūdi nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Solomoni, “Ī lina lyane nakūlītūūla ilalī ū mu hekalu yenīyī, nū mu nzengo gwa Yelusalemu ūyo naagūsola kūfuma mu ng'anda jose ja Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli ūlū būbiza bilang'hani, na bīshikīlīja mu welwa ng'holò pyī īyo naabalagīla, na būshidima ī shilagīlo ī shose īsho wabinha Musa ntūmami wane, natalajileka hangī ī mhambala jabo jishimīze kūja ūko na ūko, kwīnga ū mu sī īyo naabinha bakūlūgenji babo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū batadegelekile; ū Manase walī wabatūnja kūngī, nose ū būbi ūbo baalī bīīta walī būtaale no, kūgatinda na a mahanga ayo SEEBA walī wagayagaja gīkī gabīngīle a Baisilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūhangwa kwa kūgwa kwa Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūhaya mu nzīla ya batūmami bakwe a bahangi gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū Manase ū ntemi wa Yuda wītile mihayo ya malofu no, nīyo kūheeba nū mumo bīītīlaga a Baamooli a bose abo bikalaga ū mu sī īyī mu shikū ja kale; a banhū ba Yuda wabatongeelile mu būhūbi būtaale no kūlwa shiikolile shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīhaya, ‘Managi gīkī nakwenha būkenaagūji būtaale ū mu Yelusalemu nī Yuda; būlī munhū ūyo akwigwa gakūzīlīng'hana",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lola 1Sa 3:11.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " a matū gakwe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nang'ha ūyo nakagūtūmamīla kwītūla Samalia, nūntūlīla na Ahabu, nakūgūtūmamīla nī Yelusalemu. Nakwīpyagūla yeele ī Yelusalemu gītī munhū akūpyagūlaga sahani, wa kūhayūmala ū kwīpyagūla wīkundīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūbūponya ū būshiigo wa banhū ba wingīji wane, nabatūūle mu makono ga banishi babo; pye a banishi babo bakūbaheeba na kūbiboneela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno bīītile yabūbi ū mu miso gane, būnipelanya, nīyo kūfuma mu shikū ja bakūlūgenji babo aho bīngaga Misili, kūshisha haha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī a higūlya ya būhūbi ūbo akabenheleja banhū ba Yuda ū Manase, kūshisha bīīta būkenaagūji būtaale ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, akīīta mininga mingī no, nose ī Yelusalemu ī yose pyī ūmo īgelelile wīyookaja mininga ga banhū abo baalī batī na būbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Manase, pyī īyo wīta, nū būkenaagūji ūbo akīīta; ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Manase wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa kwikūlū lyakwe, mu ngūnda gwakwe gwa Uza. Ng'witūnja wakwe Amoni ūbiza ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amoni kūbiza ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Amoni aho alandya kūbiza ntemi walī na myaka makūmi abīlī n'ībīlī, ūsuga ū mu Yelusalemu ikanza lya myaka ībīlī. Ū nina witanagwa ī lina lyakwe Meshulemeti, nshīke o ng'wa Haluzi muna Yotiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akīīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, gīt'ūmo ise Manase walī wītīla; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nguno ya kūshimīzīla mu nzīla ja ng'wa ise ī jose, ī shiikolile pyī īsho washilamyaga ū ise, nū wei ūyūshilamya na kūshitumamīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bakwe ūng'wība, atashimīzīlile gete ū mu nzīla ja ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batūmami bakwe būng'wijomboka būmūlagīla ng'wikūlū lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū ba mu sī yakwe būbabūlaga abo bakamūlaga ū ntemi Amoni, būntemya ng'witūnja wakwe Yosia a ha ng'wanya gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Amoni, pyī īyo wīta yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūjīkwa mu shigila shakwe mu ngūnda gwa Uza. Ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Yosia ūbiza ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
